							src="/logo.png"
							alt="The Concepts Adda Logo"
						/>

					</div>

				</div>


				<div class="about-content">

					<div class="section-label">
						ABOUT THE CONCEPTS ADDA
					</div>

					<h2>
						Mathematics becomes
						<br />
						easier&nbsp;
						<span class="blue-text">
							when you understand
						</span>
						<br />
						<span class="blue-text">
							it.
						</span>
					</h2>

					<p>
						The Concepts Adda is focused on making Mathematics
						simpler through concepts, examples, practice and
						consistent learning.
					</p>

				</div>

			</div>

		</section>


		<!-- =========================
		     CLASSES
		========================= -->

		<section class="classes-section" id="classes">

			<div class="section-container">

				<div class="section-heading">

